docs {
  Fetch a Move package's full module/datatype/function layout.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.MovePackageService` · **Method:** `GetPackage` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `package_id` (required string): the storage ID of the package.

  Example uses `0x2`, the Sui Framework package, present on every network.
  The response is the full decoded module layout, so it can be large.

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
